<title>USA: PHLX to list Boston Beer options on Nov 27.</title>
<headline>PHLX to list Boston Beer options on Nov 27.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Philadelphia Stock Exchange (PHLX) said Thursday it will list options on Boston Beer Co Inc shares on November 27.</p>
<p>The options will have opening strike prices of 10, 12 and 15 and expirations in December, January, March and June, the exchange said.</p>
<p>It said Professional Edge Fund will be the specialist.</p>
<p>Shares of the beer and ale brewer were down 1/8 at 12 in morning trading Thursday.</p>
<p>--Derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
<p>E-mail: derivatives@reuters.com</p>
